ap<String, String> getDimensionFilters() {\n        return dimensionFilters;\n    }\n\n    public Instant getTimestamp() {\n        return timestamp;\n    }\n\n    public String getSourceSystem() {\n        return sourceSystem;\n    }\n}\n"
